@item email
@tab @code{protean-extras-open-email}
@tab mu4e's renderer@comma{} in a buffer of its own
@item Slack
@tab @code{protean-extras-open-slack}
@tab emacs-slack@comma{} the room or the thread
@item Signal
@tab @code{protean-extras-open-signal}
@tab sgn (@code{sgn-message-buffer})
@item Telegram
